# 43UA7500ZUA, the US 43-inch UA75: the models DB lists it for this OTA ID (W25P 33.31.61.01).
# The default board (board_cmdline in guest/targets/soc/), from W25P's own generators:
# hw-option-gen decodes K25LP, countryType US, 2G, LCD, UD,
# EPI, 60 Hz panel and SoC output, 1920x1080 graphics; nyx-option-gen ATSC.
# countryGrp 2: configd's USA RMM grpCode. tvregion ATSC: the broadcast system. chip=K25 is the
# literal of W25P's U-Boot (boot.pak). ToolOpt: LLS's factory default record of this line (the
# same for the US and European lines), with the UA75/43" panelInch and toolType of the firmware's
# factory tables. Identity placeholders are replaced per VM.
ethaddr=02:00:00:12:34:56
devtmpfs.mount=1
countryGrp=2
modelopt=000000000
hwopt=500200000004002000
ToolOpt=34747914:1343510:1148929:65:24773686:582208267
modelName=43UA7500ZUA
debugMode=3
serialNum=000RAXX00001
chip=K25
tvregion=ATSC
emmc_size=0x1d2000000
cmdEnd
